###
### Cliente - GET all
GET {{TestExam_HostAddress}}/Cliente
Accept: application/json

###
### Cliente - GET by id
GET {{TestExam_HostAddress}}/Cliente/{{clienteId}}
Accept: application/json

###
### Cliente - POST
POST {{TestExam_HostAddress}}/Cliente
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Ana",
  "apellido": "Diaz",
  "documento": "30111222",
  "email": "ana.diaz@test.com",
  "telefono": "1134567890",
  "direccionId": {{direccionId}}
}

###
### Cliente - PUT
PUT {{TestExam_HostAddress}}/Cliente/{{clienteId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 0,
  "nombre": "Ana Maria",
  "apellido": "Diaz",
  "documento": "30111222",
  "email": "anamaria.diaz@test.com",
  "telefono": "1199998888",
  "direccionId": {{direccionId}}
}

